ChaosSCV105.d2s is src/D2SSharp.Tests/Resources/105/ChaosSC.d2s from D2SSharp
(https://github.com/ResurrectedTrader/D2SSharp), byte for byte as in commit baf955a
(git blob 4c6b9a78a53b611236b2d8c7a384d6d7cd24da7d). The file was added in commit
37f367e ("feat: Add version 100-105 format support", 2026-03-01), authored by the
repository owner ResurrectedTrader, and has not been changed since.

The D2SSharp repository has no LICENSE file and no copyright line. It states the MIT
License in two places: the "License" section of its README, and the
<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression> property (with
<Authors>ResurrectedTrader</Authors>) in src/D2SSharp/D2SSharp.csproj. The MIT License
text below is the standard text; the copyright holder is the author named in the
csproj, ResurrectedTrader.

